<title>BELGIUM: EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for Luxembourg.</title>
<headline>EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for Luxembourg.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Luxembourg, released on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 3.7	 3.9</p>
<p> Investment (pct)		 4.0	 1.0</p>
<p> Inflation (pct)		  1.7	 1.9</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	     3.3	 3.5</p>
<p> Govt surplus/GDP ratio	 1.1	 1.0</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		   6.5	 6.8</p>
</text>
